#: qml/ConfigBehavior.qml:50
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you're using this setting to work around an application that demands "
"attention too often, first look for a setting in the app to disable that "
"behavior. If you don't find one, consider reporting this as a bug to the "
"app's developer."
msgstr ""
"Kui kasutad seda seadet liiga tihti tähelepanu nõudva rakenduse ümber "
"töötamiseks, otsi kõigepealt rakendusest seadet selle käitumise keelamiseks."
" Kui te seda ei leia, kaaluge sellest rakenduse arendajale veast teatamist."

